{
  "$otools": "model_manager",
  "defaults": {
    "image": "vllm/vllm-openai@sha256:7feb2a09304e3b2d38e224a100316e84fe3205faa7605060609e2c02179cbca6",
    "host": "0.0.0.0",
    "gpus": "all",
    "remote": null,
    "remotes": [],
    "hf_cache": "~/.cache/huggingface",
    "env": {
      "HF_TOKEN": null,
      "VLLM_LOGGING_COLOR": "1",
      "FORCE_COLOR": "1"
    },
    "docker_flags": [
      "--privileged",
      "--network",
      "host",
      "--ipc=host",
      "--shm-size=16g",
      "--ulimit",
      "memlock=-1",
      "--ulimit",
      "stack=67108864"
    ],
    "vllm_args": {
      "trust-remote-code": true
    }
  },
  "models": {
    "qwen3.6-35b-nvfp4": {
      "model": "nvidia/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-NVFP4",
      "port": 8000,
      "usecase": [
        "Reasoning",
        "Agentic",
        "General"
      ],
      "vllm_args": {
        "tensor-parallel-size": 1,
        "kv-cache-dtype": "fp8",
        "attention-backend": "flashinfer",
        "moe-backend": "marlin",
        "gpu-memory-utilization": 0.4,
        "max-model-len": 262144,
        "max-num-seqs": 4,
        "max-num-batched-tokens": 8192,
        "enable-chunked-prefill": true,
        "async-scheduling": true,
        "enable-prefix-caching": true,
        "speculative-config": "{\"method\":\"mtp\",\"num_speculative_tokens\":3,\"moe_backend\":\"triton\"}",
        "load-format": "fastsafetensors",
        "reasoning-parser": "qwen3",
        "tool-call-parser": "qwen3_xml",
        "enable-auto-tool-choice": true,
        "enable-log-requests": true
      }
    },
    "qwen3.6-35b-a3b-fp8": {
      "notes": [
        "Qwen3.6-35B-A3B FP8 (e4m3): hybrid GDN/Mamba MoE (qwen3_5_moe), multimodal (image-text-to-text), reasoning (thinking ON by default), tool-calling. Requires vLLM >= 0.19.0.",
        "Blackwell / DGX Spark (sm_121): VLLM_USE_DEEP_GEMM=0 is REQUIRED -- DeepGEMM E8M0 FP8-MoE weight processing crashes at load (Unknown SF transformation) and drops accuracy ~4% (vLLM #37804). Disabled, FP8-MoE falls back to TRITON, the working backend on sm_121 (#43507).",
        "Perf (256-tok decode, vs NVFP4 sibling): ~55 tok/s single-stream, ~136 tok/s at 4x concurrency. NVFP4 is ~1.7x faster single-stream but flat under load -- prefer NVFP4 for latency, this profile for concurrent throughput.",
        "First launch with --keep so a startup crash's logs survive (detached --rm removes them)."
      ],
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8",
      "port": 8000,
      "usecase": [
        "Reasoning",
        "Vision",
        "Agentic"
      ],
      "env": {
        "VLLM_USE_DEEP_GEMM": "0"
      },
      "vllm_args": {
        "served-model-name": "qwen3.6-35b-a3b-fp8",
        "tensor-parallel-size": 1,
        "kv-cache-dtype": "fp8",
        "gpu-memory-utilization": 0.9,
        "max-model-len": 262144,
        "max-num-seqs": 4,
        "enable-chunked-prefill": true,
        "reasoning-parser": "qwen3",
        "tool-call-parser": "qwen3_coder",
        "enable-auto-tool-choice": true,
        "enable-log-requests": true
      }
    },
    "qwen3.6-35b-bf16": {
      "notes": [
        "Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B (BF16 base, qwen3_5_moe MoE: 35B total / ~3B active). 256K native context, MTP speculative decoding, fp8 KV cache. Requires vLLM >= 0.19.0.",
        "Multimodal (image-text-to-text). Add --language-model-only to serve text-only and free VRAM for KV cache.",
        "BF16 weights ~70GB -- needs a large-VRAM GPU (or raise tensor-parallel-size); tune gpu-memory-utilization / max-num-seqs to your hardware."
      ],
      "image": "vllm/vllm-openai:v0.20.0",
      "model": "Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B",
      "port": 8000,
      "usecase": [
        "Reasoning",
        "Agentic",
        "General"
      ],
      "vllm_args": {
        "served-model-name": "qwen/qwen3.6-35b",
        "tensor-parallel-size": 1,
        "dtype": "bfloat16",
        "kv-cache-dtype": "fp8",
        "gpu-memory-utilization": 0.9,
        "max-model-len": 262144,
        "max-num-seqs": 2,
        "enable-chunked-prefill": true,
        "speculative-config": "{\"method\":\"mtp\",\"num_speculative_tokens\":3}",
        "enable-auto-tool-choice": true,
        "tool-call-parser": "qwen3_coder",
        "reasoning-parser": "qwen3",
        "enable-log-requests": true
      }
    },
    "nemotron-3-super-120b-nvfp4-256k": {
      "notes": [
        "Container PINNED to v0.20.0 (NOT nightly).",
        "super_v3_reasoning_parser.py is auto-downloaded (see assets) and mounted to /app -- no need to have it in your cwd.",
        "256K context, up to 4 concurrent users (max-num-seqs 4). ~4KB/token KV (fp8, hybrid) -> 256K seq ~1 GiB; 4 of them ~4 GiB."
      ],
      "image": "vllm/vllm-openai:v0.20.0",
      "model": "nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Super-120B-A12B-NVFP4",
      "port": 8000,
      "usecase": [
        "Reasoning",
        "Agentic",
        "Long-context"
      ],
      "env": {
        "VLLM_NVFP4_GEMM_BACKEND": "marlin",
        "VLLM_ALLOW_LONG_MAX_MODEL_LEN": "1",
        "VLLM_FLASHINFER_ALLREDUCE_BACKEND": "trtllm",
        "VLLM_USE_FLASHINFER_MOE_FP4": "0"
      },
      "assets": [
        {
          "url": "https://huggingface.co/nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Super-120B-A12B-NVFP4/resolve/main/super_v3_reasoning_parser.py",
          "container": "/app/super_v3_reasoning_parser.py"
        }
      ],
      "vllm_args": {
        "served-model-name": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super",
        "tensor-parallel-size": 1,
        "pipeline-parallel-size": 1,
        "data-parallel-size": 1,
        "dtype": "auto",
        "quantization": "fp4",
        "kv-cache-dtype": "fp8",
        "mamba_ssm_cache_dtype": "float16",
        "moe-backend": "marlin",
        "gpu-memory-utilization": 0.9,
        "max-model-len": 262144,
        "max-num-seqs": 4,
        "enable-chunked-prefill": true,
        "async-scheduling": true,
        "speculative-config": "{\"method\":\"mtp\",\"num_speculative_tokens\":3,\"moe_backend\":\"triton\"}",
        "reasoning-parser-plugin": "/app/super_v3_reasoning_parser.py",
        "reasoning-parser": "super_v3",
        "enable-auto-tool-choice": true,
        "tool-call-parser": "qwen3_coder"
      }
    },
    "nemotron-3-super-120b-nvfp4-1m": {
      "extends": "nemotron-3-super-120b-nvfp4-256k",
      "notes": [
        "1M context, up to 2 concurrent users (max-num-seqs 2).",
        "Card defaults config to 256k; VLLM_ALLOW_LONG_MAX_MODEL_LEN=1 (inherited) + --max-model-len 1048576 unlocks the full 1M. ~4KB/token KV (fp8, hybrid) -> 1M seq ~4 GiB; 2 of them ~8 GiB."
      ],
      "usecase": [
        "Long-context",
        "Reasoning",
        "Agentic"
      ],
      "vllm_args": {
        "max-model-len": 1048576,
        "max-num-seqs": 2
      }
    },
    "qwen3.6-27b-nvfp4-256k": {
      "notes": [
        "unsloth Qwen3.6-27B NVFP4 -- 256K (native) context, MTP speculative decoding, up to 2 concurrent users."
      ],
      "image": "vllm/vllm-openai:v0.20.0",
      "model": "unsloth/Qwen3.6-27B-NVFP4",
      "port": 8000,
      "usecase": [
        "Coding",
        "Agentic",
        "Reasoning"
      ],
      "env": {
        "VLLM_NVFP4_GEMM_BACKEND": "marlin",
        "VLLM_ALLOW_LONG_MAX_MODEL_LEN": "1"
      },
      "vllm_args": {
        "served-model-name": "unsloth/qwen3.6-27b",
        "tensor-parallel-size": 1,
        "dtype": "bfloat16",
        "kv-cache-dtype": "fp8",
        "gpu-memory-utilization": 0.9,
        "max-model-len": 262144,
        "max-num-seqs": 2,
        "enable-chunked-prefill": true,
        "speculative-config": "{\"method\":\"mtp\",\"num_speculative_tokens\":3}",
        "enable-auto-tool-choice": true,
        "tool-call-parser": "qwen3_coder",
        "reasoning-parser": "qwen3",
        "enable-log-requests": true
      }
    },
    "qwen3.6-27b-nvfp4-512k": {
      "notes": [
        "unsloth Qwen3.6-27B NVFP4 -- 512K context via YaRN rope scaling (--hf-overrides), single user (max-num-seqs 1), no spec decoding."
      ],
      "image": "vllm/vllm-openai:v0.20.0",
      "model": "unsloth/Qwen3.6-27B-NVFP4",
      "port": 8000,
      "usecase": [
        "Long-context",
        "Coding",
        "Reasoning"
      ],
      "env": {
        "VLLM_NVFP4_GEMM_BACKEND": "marlin",
        "VLLM_ALLOW_LONG_MAX_MODEL_LEN": "1"
      },
      "vllm_args": {
        "served-model-name": "unsloth/qwen3.6-27b",
        "tensor-parallel-size": 1,
        "dtype": "bfloat16",
        "kv-cache-dtype": "fp8",
        "gpu-memory-utilization": 0.92,
        "max-model-len": 524288,
        "max-num-seqs": 1,
        "enable-chunked-prefill": true,
        "hf-overrides": "{\"text_config\": {\"rope_parameters\": {\"mrope_interleaved\": true, \"mrope_section\": [11, 11, 10], \"rope_type\": \"yarn\", \"rope_theta\": 10000000, \"partial_rotary_factor\": 0.25, \"factor\": 2.0, \"original_max_position_embeddings\": 262144}}}",
        "enable-auto-tool-choice": true,
        "tool-call-parser": "qwen3_coder",
        "reasoning-parser": "qwen3",
        "enable-log-requests": true
      }
    },
    "glm-4.7-flash": {
      "notes": [
        "zai-org/GLM-4.7-Flash on the nightly aarch64 image (DGX Spark = ARM); MLA attention (VLLM_ATTENTION_BACKEND=TRITON_MLA); high concurrency (max-num-seqs 64). Recipe has no port -> defaults to 8000."
      ],
      "image": "vllm/vllm-openai:nightly-aarch64",
      "model": "zai-org/GLM-4.7-Flash",
      "port": 8000,
      "usecase": [
        "Agentic",
        "Reasoning",
        "General"
      ],
      "env": {
        "VLLM_ATTENTION_BACKEND": "TRITON_MLA"
      },
      "vllm_args": {
        "served-model-name": "glm-4.7-flash",
        "tensor-parallel-size": 1,
        "tool-call-parser": "glm47",
        "reasoning-parser": "glm45",
        "enable-auto-tool-choice": true,
        "max-model-len": 202752,
        "max-num-seqs": 64,
        "max-num-batched-tokens": 4096,
        "gpu-memory-utilization": 0.85
      }
    }
  }
}
